links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/16139","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089380"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=16139"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/16139\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":21222,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/16139\/revisions\/21222"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/16126"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=16139"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=16139"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=16139"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=16139"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":16203,"date":"2022-11-17T16:40:17","date_gmt":"2022-11-17T16:40:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=16203"},"modified":"2023-06-07T09:49:30","modified_gmt":"2023-06-07T13:49:30","slug":"matic-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/matic-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network","title":{"rendered":"MATIC deposits and withdrawals available on the Polygon Network!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports deposits and withdrawals of <\/span><b><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/polygon\">Polygon<\/a> (MATIC) on the Polygon Network<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">!<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In addition to supporting MATIC natively on Polygon, we will continue to support deposits and withdrawals of MATIC on the Ethereum network (ERC-20).<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding, trading and staking<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Funding and trading are already live<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> You can transfer MATIC tokens to your Kraken account by navigating to <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/funding\"><b>Funding<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, selecting <\/span><b>MATIC<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and in the drop-down box the desired deposit method (network): either Ethereum (ERC-20) or Polygon network. Please note that any other deposit methods will result in lost MATIC tokens.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Earn up to 14% in yearly rewards by staking your MATIC from the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/u\/earn\/staking\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Earn<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> section of your Kraken account or from your <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/slp\/kraken-pro-app\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pro mobile app<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. MATIC staking on Kraken is gasless, meaning there are no network transaction fees for staking and unstaking or for claiming and withdrawing staking rewards. Additionally, Kraken makes it easy for you to stake and unstake at any time, with no lockup periods.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s what you need to know about the asset:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Polygon (MATIC) <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">is a Layer 2 scaling solution and development infrastructure for Ethereum. Polygon increases the transaction throughput for Ethereum-based assets and uses a modular framework to support the execution of interoperable smart contracts. MATIC is the utility token of the platform which is used to pay for network transaction fees, earn rewards for securing the network through staking and vote on decisions that affect the future of the platform.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check out the Kraken Learn Center guide <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/learn\/what-is-polygon-matic\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What is Polygon?<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to learn more.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Will Kraken make more assets available?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details until shortly before launch \u2013 including which assets we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s available tokens can be found <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360000678446-Cryptocurrencies-available-on-Kraken\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and all future tokens will be announced on Kraken\u2019s blog and social media profiles. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which assets we may be making available in the future.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Trade with caution<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There is no guarantee that a limit order will execute. There is also no guarantee a market order will execute at a certain price. The availability and liquidity of the particular digital asset will impact these types of orders.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/go\/referrals\/\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"15784\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/subhead_reflink-1\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?fit=1200%2C250&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1200,250\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"subhead_reflink (1)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Referral cta image&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?fit=1024%2C213&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15784\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=1200%2C250&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=300%2C63&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=1024%2C213&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=768%2C160&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/subhead_reflink-1.png?resize=200%2C42&amp;ssl=1 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These materials are for general information purposes only and are not investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy, sell or hold any cryptoasset or to engage in any specific trading strategy. Some crypto products and markets are unregulated, and you may not be protected by government compensation and\/or regulatory protection schemes. The unpredictable nature of the cryptoasset markets can lead to loss of funds. Tax may be payable on any return and\/or on any increase in the value of your cryptoassets and you should seek independent advice on your taxation position.<\/span><\/i><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports deposits and withdrawals of Polygon (MATIC) on the Polygon Network! In addition to supporting MATIC natively on Polygon, we will continue to support deposits and withdrawals of MATIC on the Ethereum network (ERC-20). Funding, trading and staking Funding and trading are already live. You can transfer MATIC [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":120066484,"featured_media":16251,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1789,1426],"tags":[1545],"language":[],"class_list":["post-16203","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-asset-listings","category-product","tag-matic"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>MATIC deposits and withdrawals available on the Polygon Network! - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/matic-deposits-and-withdrawals-avail