d withdrawals of Polygon (MATIC) on the Polygon Network! In addition to supporting MATIC natively on Polygon, we will continue to support deposits and withdrawals of MATIC on the Ethereum network (ERC-20). Funding, trading and staking Funding and trading are already live. You can transfer MATIC [&hellip;]","og_url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/matic-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network","og_site_name":"Kraken Blog","article_published_time":"2022-11-17T16:40:17+00:00","article_modified_time":"2023-06-07T13:49:30+00:00","og_image":[{"width":1536,"height":700,"url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/MATIC_Blog.png?fit=1536%2C700&ssl=1","type":"image\/png"}],"author":"krakenfx","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Written by":"krakenfx","Est. reading time":"2 minutes"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/matic-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/matic-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network"},"author":{"name":"krakenfx","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/461b7fbe1832d96cab8eb182c6642a21"},"headline":"MATIC deposits and withdrawals available on the Polygon Network!","datePublished":"2022-11-17T16:40:17+00:00","dateModified":"2023-06-07T13:49:30+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/matic-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network"},"wordCount":470,"publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/matic-deposits-and-withdrawals-available-on-the-polygon-network#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/MATIC_Blog.png?fit=1536%2C700&ssl=1","keywords":["matic"],"articleSection":["Asset Listings","Product"],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"