"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/16c47affada0c14e53e9e35216ec483ad12bcc35fd4cea0d6a2dd22cde9a6038?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","url":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/16c47affada0c14e53e9e35216ec483ad12bcc35fd4cea0d6a2dd22cde9a6038?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","contentUrl":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/16c47affada0c14e53e9e35216ec483ad12bcc35fd4cea0d6a2dd22cde9a6038?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","caption":"KrakenFX"},"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/author\/danielpintokraken"}]}},"jetpack_likes_enabled":false,"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/peDd1v-4h4","jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/NFT_Listing_VID2_BlogInner.png?fit=1536%2C700&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/16434","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089380"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=16434"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/16434\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":21159,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/16434\/revisions\/21159"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/16431"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=16434"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=16434"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=16434"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=16434"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":16510,"date":"2022-12-08T16:07:05","date_gmt":"2022-12-08T16:07:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=16510"},"modified":"2023-05-09T07:54:24","modified_gmt":"2023-05-09T11:54:24","slug":"announcing-the-kraken-100m-volume-fee-tier-trial","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/announcing-the-kraken-100m-volume-fee-tier-trial","title":{"rendered":"Announcing the Kraken $100M+ volume fee tier trial"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting December 15, 2022 0:00 UTC through February 15, 2023 11:59 UTC*, we will offer 0% maker and 0.08% taker fees on select spot pairs to qualifying clients as part of our $100M+ volume fee tier trial.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Who is eligible?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All clients who trade over $100M in total spot crypto volume on a 30-day rolling basis will automatically be placed in the trial\u2019s new fee tier.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trading volume is calculated across all traded pairs with the exception of markets where stablecoins or fiat currencies are the base currency (the first currency listed in a pair \u2013 in USDC\/USD, USDC is the base currency). Click <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360039299431-How-do-stablecoin-FX-fees-work-\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for more info on how trading fees for our stablecoins and FX pairs work.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The 30-day rolling volume is computed on a continuous basis.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>What Kraken platforms are included in the trial?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The trial applies to pairs that are traded directly on spot order books, including via mobile, web and API, but does <\/span><b>not<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> include pairs traded on the Kraken Consumer App or Kraken Derivatives.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>How do the trial\u2019s fees differ from Kraken\u2019s stated fees?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We charge a fee when we match client orders. The fee ranges from 0% (0 bps) to 0.26% (26 bps) of the total cost (value) of your order and depends on the following:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/help\/fees\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">currency pair being traded<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/202966886\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">30-day volume (in USD)<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Whether your order is a <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360000526126\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">maker or taker<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For this trial, we\u2019re introducing the $100M+ volume fee tier as part of our spot crypto trading fee schedule. Clients who reach $100M in 30-day trading volume will now incur 8 bps (instead of 10 bps) taker fees when trading the 309 spot pairs included in the trial.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The trial will run on 50% of crypto pairs offered on Kraken from December 15, 2022 0:00 UTC through February 15, 2022 11:59 UTC.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>How can I confirm I\u2019m eligible?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All clients are eligible as long as they meet the required volume threshold.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The easiest way to tell if you\u2019re eligible is via your Fee Schedule (Fees) progress bar. You can keep track of your current fees and progress toward lower fees by looking at the Fees progress bar in your account overview:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Select the Kraken logo on the upper left when you are logged in to your account<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Scroll down below trade balances<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please note that the fee schedule progress bar is market-specific and will only show fees that apply to your currently selected market:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"16554\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/image-1-4\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/image-1.jpg?fit=3180%2C292&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"3180,292\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"image (1)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/image-1.jpg?fit=1024%2C94&amp;ssl=1\" class=\" wp-image-16554 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/image-1.jpg?resize=814%2C76&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"814\" height=\"76\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/image-1.jpg?resize=300%2C28&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/image-1.jpg?resize=1024%2C94&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/image-1.jpg?resize=768%2C71&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/image-1.jpg?resize=1536%2C141&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/image-1.jpg?resize=2048%2C188&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/image-1.jpg?resize=200%2C18&amp;ssl=1 200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/image-1.jpg?w=3000&amp;ssl=1 3000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 814px) 100vw, 814px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Don\u2019t hesitate to <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/institutions\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">reach out<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to an account manager or <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken support<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> if you have any questions about participation in the trial. Our teams are available 24\/7.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Why is Kraken running this trial?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This trial will enable client strategies that are extremely fee-sensitive and allow us to assess the overall impact on order book liquidity. We will also be able to see how the new fees impact our trading ecosystem.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Which spot trading pairs will be included and why?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Included trading pairs provide the trial with 50% coverage of our markets, both in terms of number of markets and trading volume.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In order to programmatically determine which pairs are included in the trial, you can call the \/AssetPairs public endpoint on our REST API, where fees for a specific pair will be returned as part of the Fees array.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Click <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/sections\/4402371110548-API\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for more info on how to use our API. Click <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/docs.kraken.com\/rest\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for our REST API documentation.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/institutions\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Contact<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> your account manager or <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kraken support<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> with any questions.<\/span><b><i><br \/>\n<\/i><\/b><b><i><br \/>\n<\/i><\/b><b>The following 309 spot pairs will be included in the trial:<\/b><\/p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Base asset<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>Quote asset<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>Trading pair<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/aave\"><b>Aave (AAVE)<\/b><\/a><\/td>\n<td><b>AUD<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>AAVEAUD<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>ETH<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>AAVEETH<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>EUR<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>AAVEEUR<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>GBP<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>AAVEGBP<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/acala-dollar\"><b>Acala (ACA)<\/b><\/a><\/td>\n<td><b>EUR<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>ACAEUR<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>USD<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>ACAUSD<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/prices\/alchemy-pay\"><b>Alchemy Pay (ACH)<\/b><\/a><\/td>\n<td><b>EUR<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>ACHEUR<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>USD<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>ACHUSD<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\